                                "sense_id": "623dc30f-81f2-3689-afc5-707a1f1597a3",
                                "text": "Tycoon George Fisher Baker built Harvard's Business School in 1924, was given a kudo Ph.D."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c132926d-bf37-43e0-ad5c-1f7b42babfb4",
                                "sense_id": "623dc30f-81f2-3689-afc5-707a1f1597a3",
                                "text": "At this point we need to give this pilot a kudo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "523b3797-8d69-498d-9cf5-d02c5cb4b24e",
                                "sense_id": "623dc30f-81f2-3689-afc5-707a1f1597a3",
                                "text": "We still feel a kudo for one of us is a kudo for the group, as we have nurtured, edited, and prodded each other for much of our writing careers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
